    "TXT_KEY_DOOM_BLIGHT": "Blight",
    "TXT_KEY_DOOM_BLIGHT_HELP": "Every city outside the Infernals gains unhealthiness (10 plus its population, less its good health from buildings). Every living unit takes 25% death damage.",
