    "TXT_KEY_DOOM_FOUR_HORSEMEN_HELP": "40: Stephanos appears. 50: Buboes appears. 60: Yersinia appears. 70: Ars Moriendi appears.",
    "TXT_KEY_DOOM_HELLFIRE": "Hellfire",
    "TXT_KEY_DOOM_HELLFIRE_HELP": "Empty flat land plots without a bonus may become Hellfire, each with a demon Champion of the Infernals (else of the barbarians).",
