    "TXT_KEY_DOOM_WRATH_HELP": "Wrath appears. Each living land unit that is not a world unit may become Enraged.",
    "TXT_KEY_DOOM_APOCALYPSE": "Apocalypse",
    "TXT_KEY_DOOM_APOCALYPSE_HELP": "Every city outside the Fallow loses half its population. Every living unit may die."
